      "label": "common_0095_rival_03",
      "hash64": "C21E4049095E50C0",
      "text": "對了，我說過要教[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n怎麼捉寶可夢！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
